    "cellCounter": 46,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# UnifyWeaver 中的高级递归模式\n\n本笔记本演示了 UnifyWeaver 能够检测和优化的四种主要递归模式：\n\n1. **尾递归 (Tail Recursion)** - 带累加器的迭代循环\n2. **线性递归 (Linear Recursion)** - 带记忆化的单次递归调用\n3. **树形递归 (Tree Recursion)** - 在结构各部分上的多次递归调用\n4. **互递归 (Mutual Recursion)** - 循环相互调用的谓词\n\n## 学习目标\n\n- 理解不同的递归模式\n- 了解 UnifyWeaver 如何检测和优化每种模式\n- 比较性能特征\n- 掌握何时使用每种模式",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## 环境配置\n\n初始化 UnifyWeaver 环境。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "% 加载初始化\n['../init'].\n\n% 加载必要的模块\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/recursive_compiler)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/pattern_matchers)).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Cannot find file: ../init",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Cannot find file: ../init</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 模式 1：尾递归 (Tail Recursion)\n\n尾递归使用累加器传递中间结果，且递归调用是函数中的**最后一个操作**。\n\n### 示例：统计列表中的元素个数",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "% 定义尾递归 count_items\n:- dynamic count_items/3.\n\n% 基本情况：空列表，返回累加器\ncount_items([], Acc, Acc).\n\n% 递归情况：递增累加器，对尾部进行递归\ncount_items([_|T], Acc, N) :-\n    Acc1 is Acc + 1,\n    count_items(T, Acc1, N).  % ← 尾部位置！",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "### 在 Prolog 中测试",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "% 测试：统计 [a,b,c,d,e] 中的元素\n\\+ \\+ (\n    count_items([a,b,c,d,e], 0, _N),\n    format('Count: ~w~n', [_N])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Count: 5",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Count: 5</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "### 检查模式检测结果",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
