      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "## 模式 2：线性递归 (Linear Recursion)\n\n线性递归在每个子句中包含**恰好一个**递归调用，计算在递归调用返回后进行。\n\n### 示例：阶乘 (Factorial)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "% 定义阶乘\n:- dynamic factorial/2.\n\n% 基本情况\nfactorial(0, 1).\n\n% 递归情况：恰好一次递归调用\nfactorial(N, F) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    factorial(N1, F1),  % ← 一次递归调用\n    F is N * F1.        % ← 调用后的计算",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "### 在 Prolog 中测试",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "% 测试：5 的阶乘\n\\+ \\+ (\n    factorial(5, _F),\n    format('5! = ~w~n', [_F])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "5! = 120",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">5! = 120</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "### 检查模式检测结果",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "code": "% 检查是否被检测为线性递归\nis_linear_recursive_streamable(factorial/2),\nwriteln('✓ Detected as linear recursion').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
