      {
        "id": 24,
        "code": "## 模式 3：树形递归 (Tree Recursion)\n\n树形递归进行**多次**递归调用以处理结构的不同部分。\n\n### 示例：树节点求和 (Tree Sum)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "code": "% 定义二叉树的 tree_sum\n% 树格式：[值, 左子树, 右子树] 或 []\n:- dynamic tree_sum/2.\n\n% 基本情况：空树的和为 0\ntree_sum([], 0).\n\n% 递归情况：和 = 值 + 左子树和 + 右子树和\ntree_sum([V, L, R], Sum) :-\n    tree_sum(L, LS),   % ← 第一次递归调用\n    tree_sum(R, RS),   % ← 第二次递归调用\n    Sum is V + LS + RS.",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "code": "### 在 Prolog 中测试",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "code": "% 测试：[5, [3, [1, [], []], []], [2, [], []]] 的 tree_sum\n%       5\n%      / \\\n%     3   2\n%    /\n%   1\n\\+ \\+ (\n    tree_sum([5, [3, [1, [], []], []], [2, [], []]], _Sum),\n    format('Tree sum: ~w (expected 11)~n', [_Sum])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Tree sum: 11 (expected 11)",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Tree sum: 11 (expected 11)</pre>"
      },
