      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "code": "## 模式 4：互递归 (Mutual Recursion)\n\n当两个或多个谓词在一个循环中相互调用时，就会发生互递归。\n\n### 示例：偶数 (Even) 与奇数 (Odd)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "code": "% 定义互递归的 is_even 和 is_odd\n:- dynamic is_even/1.\n:- dynamic is_odd/1.\n\n% is_even 基本情况\nis_even(0).\n\n% is_even 递归：若 N-1 为奇数则 N 为偶数\nis_even(N) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    is_odd(N1).  % ← 调用 is_odd\n\n% is_odd 基本情况\nis_odd(1).\n\n% is_odd 递归：若 N-1 为偶数则 N 为奇数\nis_odd(N) :-\n    N > 1,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    is_even(N1).  % ← 调用 is_even",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "code": "### 在 Prolog 中测试",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "code": "% 测试偶数/奇数\nis_even(0), writeln('✓ 0 is even').\nis_even(4), writeln('✓ 4 is even').\nis_odd(3), writeln('✓ 3 is odd').\nis_odd(7), writeln('✓ 7 is odd').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "✓ 0 is even\n✓ 4 is even\n✓ 3 is odd\n✓ 7 is odd",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">✓ 0 is even\n✓ 4 is even\n✓ 3 is odd\n✓ 7 is odd</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "code": "### 检查互递归",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "code": "% 构建调用图并查找 SCC\n\\+ \\+ (\n    use_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)),\n    use_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/scc_detection)),\n\n    build_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\n    format('Call graph: ~w~n', [_Graph]),\n\n    find_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\n    format('SCCs (mutual recursion groups): ~w~n', [_SCCs])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "source_sink `unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)' does not exist",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">source_sink `unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)' does not exist</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "code": "### 编译为 Bash",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 39,
        "code": "% 编译互递归组\n\\+ \\+ (\n    use_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/mutual_recursion)),\n\n    compile_mutual_recursion([is_even/1, is_odd/1], [], _BashCode),\n    split_string(_BashCode, \"\\n\", \"\\r\", _BashLines),\n    append(_LibraryLines, [\"# Main dispatch: route command line calls to functions\"|_], _BashLines),\n    atomics_to_string(_LibraryLines, \"\\n\", _LibraryCode),\n    setup_call_cleanup(\n        open('../output/even_odd_demo.sh', write, _Stream),\n        write(_Stream, _LibraryCode),\n        close(_Stream)),\n    writeln('✓ Compiled is_even/is_odd to Bash with shared memoization')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
